"Sampler" by Jeff Nyman

[A tiny but complete story for trying the extension: compile it with the run button, play it in the tab that opens, then break something and watch the Problems panel.]

The Lab is a room. "A bright laboratory. A brass lamp sits on the bench."

The brass lamp is a device in the Lab. The description is "An old lamp, [if the lamp is switched on]glowing warmly[otherwise]cold and dark[end if]."

Instead of taking the lamp when the lamp is switched on:
	say "Too hot to hold."

Every turn when the lamp is switched on:
	say "The lamp hums."

Test me with "look / switch lamp on / take lamp / switch lamp off / take lamp".
